        "text": "<p>Life moved me up the Central Coast and then inland to Tamworth, where I’m raising three young boys. It’s a long way from the water, but the coast never really leaves you. Family holidays are still about the ocean, at Moonee Beach and Port Macquarie, and watching my boys get their first waves takes me straight back.</p><p>I’ve spent more than 20 years in web design, building things for other people. MUURMA is the first thing I’ve built for me. It’s a way back to my roots and the breaks that shaped me.</p><p>Every piece is designed on the east coast, in a small run, so there’s less waste and nothing sits in a warehouse. It’s honest gear for people who would rather be in the water.</p><p><em>Michael Daly, founder</em></p>",
